			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1904649">
									

<p>The original idea was that it (space dementia) just sort of spontaneously <em>happened</em>, but I was told to make it more concrete. Finding a way to explain the origins of this without making it an exact clone of 990 or 1500 was tough, and I should have given it more thought. Any suggestions? As for the final note, I didn't want to make it just &quot;whoa hey I just realized the vague and nondescript truth omg&quot;. I wanted to sort of add a real reason. I was told the note worked, but I see where you're coming from.<br />
Should I make the effects of 2000 more broad and complex or nuanced? Broad and complex is what I'm thinking right now. Thanks for the feedback!</p>

