<p>If i were you&#8230;I dunno, I might make it memetic. In the last part, the thing clearly has memetic undertones. Just don't, ah, make it a language, because there are too many of those. Mm, &quot;spontaneously happening&quot; definitely doesn't sound very interesting. But yeah, give it more thought. Memetic might not be a good idea, who knows.</p>
